### **Kubernetes concepts**

| Term       | Meaning                                 |
| ---------- | --------------------------------------- |
| Pod        | Smallest deployable unit                |
| Deployment | Manages desired Pods                    |
| ReplicaSet | Maintains Pod replicas                  |
| Service    | Stable network access                   |
| Node       | Machine running Pods                    |
| Cluster    | Group of Nodes                          |
| Minikube   | Local Kubernetes cluster                |
| kubectl    | Command-line tool to control Kubernetes |

**Most important viva:** Docker runs containers; Kubernetes manages and maintains containerized applications across a cluster.

